  "releaseNotes": "Observability: S3Server now emits OpenTelemetry-shaped metrics and traces through a System.Diagnostics Meter and ActivitySource named S3Server (S3 operations, pipeline stages, application callbacks, signature validation, errors, object sizes, build and config gauges). No exporter dependency; near-zero cost when nothing subscribes. Configure with S3ServerSettings.Telemetry. See TELEMETRY.md.",
